482	     * Derives the address an owner should carry from its submitted fields. The update path stamps an
483	     * owner with an address taken from the request, so routing that through this single method keeps the
484	     * derivation of "the owner's address" in one place, mirroring {@link #householdIdFor} for the
485	     * household id.
486	     *
487	     * @param ownerFieldsDto the submitted owner fields
488	     * @return the address to store on the owner
489	     */
490	    private String addressFor(OwnerFieldsDto ownerFieldsDto) {
491	        return ownerFieldsDto.getAddress();
492	    }
